| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `tvmaze_search_gui.py` | TVMaze graphical app and result formatting |
| `tvmaze_search.py` | TVMaze API search and command-line app |
| `app_config.py` | Loads and validates `config.ini` |
| `validation.py` | Reusable input and configuration validation |
| `logging_config.py` | Configures structured JSON logging |
| `config.ini` | API endpoint, timeout, rating, and GUI settings |
